  "drafts": [
    "For [record:Afu2g18040], the audit found a shifted splice site rather than support for the annotated junction: the annotated junction had no RNA-seq reads, while a nearby replacement junction was strongly supported [cite:stat_6044cd82.verdict.cause]. The proposed correction changes the exon boundaries but preserves the coding frame [cite:stat_6044cd82.models.proposed.frameKept].\n\nThe finding was confirmed and the independent review rated it [stat:stat_6044cd82.verdict.certainty] confidence. This is strong evidence for a splice-site correction, although the audit did not assess whether any published study depends on the original model.",
    "For [record:Afu2g18040], the audit found a shifted splice site rather than support for the annotated junction: the annotated junction had no RNA-seq reads, while a nearby replacement junction was strongly supported [cite:stat_6044cd82.review.verdict.cause]. The proposed correction changes the exon boundaries but preserves the coding frame [cite:stat_6044cd82.review.verdict.impactReason].\n\nThe independent review rated this finding high confidence [stat:stat_6044cd82.review.verdict.certainty]. This is strong evidence for a splice-site correction, although the audit did not assess whether any published study depends on the original model [cite:stat_6044cd82.reviewText.paperText]."
